==About==
The '''Esports World Cup''' is a tournament series that was announced in late 2023, building off the previously established '''Gamers8''' series. '''Rainbow Six''' was announced as part of the line-up on March 06, 2024.<ref name="EWC R6">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ESWCgg/status/1765437191696842779|title=✅ Get locked in because we've got some insane Siege for you|date=2024-03-06|author=Esports World Cup|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} English}}</ref>
:''See [https://liquipedia.net/esports/Esports_World_Cup/2024 here] to read about the Esports World Cup 2024, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

