===Format===
* '''''Group Stage:''''' ''July 31 - August 1, 2024''<ref name="EWC Format">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ESWCgg/status/1790728876684878167|title=Rainbow Six Siege at the #EsportsWorldCup|author=[[Esports World Cup]]|date=2024-05-15}} </ref>
** 2 groups of 8 teams.
** Double-elimination bracket.
** Upper bracket games are {{Abbr/Bo1}}.
** Lower bracket games are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams}} qualify to '''Playoffs'''.
* '''''Playoffs:''''' ''August 2 - 4, 2024''<ref name="EWC Format"/>
** 8 Team Single-elimination Format.
** All matches except the Grand Final are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}.

