==About==
It was originally planned to be hosted in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, but was moved to Paris, France on May 20.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/EWC_EN/status/2057121960623006162|title=Esports World Cup 2026 is coming to Paris|author=Esports World Cup|author-link=Esports World Cup|date=2026-05-20}}</ref>
:''See [https://liquipedia.net/esports/Esports_World_Cup/2026 here] to read about the Esports World Cup 2026, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

===Format===
* '''''Play in - Phase 1:'''''
** 2 groups of 4 teams.
** Double-elimination bracket.
** Opening games are {{Abbr/Bo1}}.
** All others games are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} qualify to '''Phase 2'''.
** Seeding is based on the [[Six_Invitational/2027/Global_Standings|SI standings]] at {{countdown|date=July 20, 2026 23:59 {{Abbr/AST}}|rawdatetime=true}} (July 20, 2026 at 23:59 {{Abbr/AST}}). Teams ranked higher in the SI ranking will receive higher seedings.

* '''''Play in - Phase 2:'''''
** 4 Team Single-elimination Format.
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} qualify to '''Group Stage'''.

* '''''Group Stage:'''''
** 2 groups of 8 teams.
** Double-elimination bracket.
** Opening games are {{Abbr/Bo1}}.
** All others games are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams}} qualify to '''Playoffs'''.
** Seeding is based on the [[Six_Invitational/2027/Global_Standings|SI standings]] at {{countdown|date=July 20, 2026 23:59 {{Abbr/AST}}|rawdatetime=true}} (July 20, 2026 at 23:59 {{Abbr/AST}}). Teams ranked higher in the SI ranking will receive higher seedings.

* '''''Playoffs:'''''
** 8 Team Single-elimination Format.
** All matches except the Grand Final are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}.

